Scarwood Bandits
Black Lotus x3
Mox Pearl
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Scarwood Bandits.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
